@startuml
actor Operador
boundary "Formulário Web" as UI
control "Rota Flask" as App
entity "Chamado" as Model
database "SQLite" as DB
Operador -> UI : Preenche dados
UI -> App : POST /chamados/novo
App -> App : Validar campos
App -> Model : Construir chamado
App -> DB : INSERT chamado
DB --> App : Confirma gravação
App --> UI : Redirecionar + mensagem
UI --> Operador : Exibir lista atualizada
@enduml